# Waiver Log

Formally accepted risks. Findings that won't be fixed, with rationale and a revisit date.

> Waivers are conscious risk acceptance, not casual dismissals. Every waiver has a rationale and a revisit date.
>
> **Compliance bright lines (regulatory, contractual, certification) are NOT waivable.** See `PROJECT-CONTEXT.md` → Compliance Posture → "Compliance bright lines" for items that override the standard waiver process.

